        {"check_id": "8.2", "name": "SQL 补丁最新操作失败", "source_module": "db_security", "extract": {"json_path": "db.security.failed_patch_attempts", "aggregation": "raw"}, "evaluation": {"method": "row_count"}, "optimization_advice": "请 DBA 检查 datapatch 日志并修复最后一次非 SUCCESS 的补丁操作。失败 APPLY 不证明已安装，失败 ROLLBACK 不移除之前成功安装的补丁。"},
